<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI22-IMPORTANT-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI22-IMPORTANT-001" ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-07-25T06:42:14Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AICH-S2 ;
  triage:title "Self-send guard exemption trusts unauthenticated host field, inconsistent with the module's own stricter established pattern" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/send/mod.rs validate_non_self_recipient exempts same-identity rejection whenever target.host.is_some(), without cross-checking that the host claim is actually authenticated. crates/atm-core/src/delivery_policy.rs resolve_write_recipient_snapshot already establishes a stricter pattern: 'if address.host.is_some() && !authenticated_source_host { ... }'. validate_non_self_recipient's exemption is inconsistent with this established stricter check." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "consistency" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crate" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-24T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-07-26T21:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Crimson-2f4c batch fix on fix/close-out-pre-ai27-findings @ a5659742 (PR #656). Independently re-verified, not accepted from self-report: validate_non_self_recipient (send/mod.rs:987) exempts same-identity rejection when target.host().is_some() OR provenance.is_authenticated_peer() -- unauthenticated host-qualified self-targets still pass through. Checked this against the CURRENT delivery_policy.rs::resolve_write_recipient_snapshot (line 349) and provenance.rs::is_remote_origin() (target_host_qualified && !authenticated_peer): the code no longer rejects unauthenticated host-qualified writes, it routes them as remote-origin. The 'stricter reject pattern' this finding's original description cited was based on pre-refactor code; the current established pattern is route-not-reject, and the fix is consistent with it -- not a silent gap. CI green (gh pr checks 656, 8/8), ruthless-boundary-qa PASS 0 findings." ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-001/s22/1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-001/s23/1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-001/preai27-a5659742> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s22/a5aa6813> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s23/b88ca016> ;
  triage:fixedOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s24/fc9832b3> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s24/fc9832b3> .

